question:
What is the execution order?
```javascript
console.log('start');

setImmediate(() => console.log('immediate'));
Promise.resolve().then(() => console.log('promise'));
process.nextTick(() => console.log('nextTick'));

console.log('end');
```

A developer blocks the event loop. What is the consequence?
```javascript
// Synchronous expensive operation
function blockingLoop() {
  let sum = 0;
  for (let i = 0; i < 1e9; i++) {
    sum += i;
  }
}
blockingLoop();
console.log('done');
```

What is the output when process.nextTick is called recursively?
```javascript
let count = 0;
function recurse() {
  process.nextTick(() => {
    console.log(++count);
    if (count < 3) recurse();
  });
}
recurse();
console.log('sync done');
```

When does setImmediate fire relative to setTimeout with 0ms delay?
```javascript
setTimeout(() => console.log('timeout'), 0);
setImmediate(() => console.log('immediate'));
```

What happens if an unhandled Promise rejection occurs?
```javascript
